            "review_title": "Review at Tre Place",
            "review_text": "Ginnyleeinwonderland\nHai Phong, Vietnam340 contributions\n0\nLunch and fresh air\nSep 2019\nThe restaurant was located on the river bank, it was a nice place to enjoy fresh air and a day out without using any AC. The view to the river was beautiful. Staff were nice but sometimes they questioned too much about customer's choice which was quite annoying for some people. Food was ok although the grilled pork smelled kind of weird, not as I remember what it should be with those spices they used. They only had hot beer with ice which was kind of not comfortable for me because when people put ice in beer, it changed the taste and made the beer tasteless.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 24, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
