            "review_title": "Review at Tre Place",
            "review_text": "Erica E\nHanoi, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGreat family restaurant in with bamboo garden overlooking the Red River\nOct 2016 • Family\nThis is a child-friendly place were you can sit outside having a nice and relaxed dinner with family and friends in a bamboo garden overlooking Red River. The children can run around and play and they also have a small playground. The food is good and they have a lot on their Vietnamese menu. The restaurant seems clean and the food fresh. The service is fine but it helps to have a Vietnamese speaking friend in your assembly. They also have secluded wooden huts were you can sit on mats on the floor and eat. This is also a place for Vietnamese weddings and large groups. The prices are affordable. I would really recommend this place coming here with friends and children for a nice evening without the children getting bored and wanna go home during main course.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 1, 2016",
